{"version":1,"content":"<p>據《紐約時報》報道，AI正在以前所未有的速度發現軟件安全漏洞，負責修復問題的工程師卻越來越難跟上。科技公司與開源軟件維護者正加緊修補，爭取趕在黑客利用這些漏洞之前，保護支撐大量網站和網絡服務的軟件。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584284.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:02:22.912786+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T06:42:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T06:58:55.750399+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T06:58:55.750399+00:00","content_hash":"77a0e5255a966cef4a05fd63cf43374b9f3ee3d92e2a422a329306ff0f8c645f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}